        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.286,
            0.847,
            0.323
          ],
          "content": "We can see that Step 1 has 1 triangle, Step 2 has 2 triangles, Step 3 has 3 triangles, and so on."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.323,
            0.847,
            0.362
          ],
          "content": "Step 5? It is 11. You can also draw this and see."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.369,
            0.848,
            0.429
          ],
          "content": "? How many matchsticks will there be in Step 33, Step 84, and Step 108? Of course, we can draw and count, but is there a quicker way to find the answers using the pattern present here?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.437,
            0.848,
            0.495
          ],
          "content": "What is the general rule to find the number of matchsticks in the next step? We can see that at each step 2 matchsticks are placed to get the next one, i.e., the number of matchsticks increases by 2 every time."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.24,
            0.498,
            0.76,
            0.594
          ],
          "content": "| Step Number | 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 | 5 | 6 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| No. of Matchsticks | 3 | 5 | 7 | 9 | 11 | 13 |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_19_table_13.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.605,
            0.846,
            0.643
          ],
          "content": "Think of a way to use this to find out the number of matchsticks in Step 33 (without continuing to write the numbers)."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.642,
            0.848,
            0.698
          ],
          "content": "As each time 2 matchsticks are being added, finding out how many 2s will be added in Step 33 will help. Look at the table below and try to find out."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.703,
            0.845,
            0.832
          ],
          "content": "| Step Number | 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 | 5 | 6 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| No. of Matchsticks | 3 | 5 | 7 | 9 | 11 | 13 |\n|  |  | 3 + 2 | 3 + 2 + 2 | 3 + 2 + 2 + 2 | 3 + 2 + 2 + 2 + 2 |  |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_19_table_16.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.843,
            0.848,
            0.9
          ],
          "content": "The number of matchsticks needed to make 33 triangles (Step 33) is. Similarly, find the number of matchsticks needed for Step 84 and Step 108."
